class.41:
End of no passing

Sign 3.21 indicates the end of the zone of operation of sign 3.20 and permits overtaking of vehicles if possible.
Overtaking is prohibited:
If you are in the overtaking zone (you are being overtaken);
If the distance to the oncoming vehicle is not enough to complete the overtaking.
If you are approaching a regulated intersection;
At a pedestrian crossing, if there is a pedestrian on it;
At the railway crossing and 100 meters before it;
On bridges, overpasses, overpasses and under them, as well as in tunnels;
On dangerous turns with limited visibility;
At the end of the climb.
It is installed: In places where the zone of action of the sign 3.20 ends.
